{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"哥伦比亚","country_iso":"COL","created_at":"2026-04-10T08:29:14.786596","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"COL-HB-0001","ldc":"No","location":"考卡山谷省","location_norm":"考卡省","name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"哥伦比亚太平洋工业园及太阳能电站项目","project_name_en":"Colombia Pacific Industrial Park and Solar Power Plant Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中国土木工程集团有限公司","content":"当地时间12月20日，中国土木成功签署哥伦比亚太平洋工业园及太阳能电站项目商务合同。\n该合同的签署不仅对正处于融资关闭阶段的哥伦比亚西部有轨电车项目形成了有力支持，亦标志着中国土木哥伦比亚市场开启了多元经营、滚动发展的新纪元。\n该项目位于哥伦比亚西部太平洋岸的唯一港口考卡山谷省布埃纳文图拉市，区位环境优越。\n项目主要工程内容\n为在135公顷的海岛土地上规划设计并建设轻工业园及供水系统等，包含跨海桥、土建、太阳能电力、给水、污水处理厂、通信、道路、市政配套设施等。\n项目工程范围\n涵盖的太阳能电站、污水处理厂及以“绿色加工、出口导向”为核心的轻工业园建设，充分响应了联合国《2030年可持续发展议程》中关于绿色环保可持续发展的提议。项目实施也将有效促进当地就业、拉动当地经济发展，对于中国土木在哥伦比亚彰显企业社会责任、巩固良好企业形象、进一步深耕哥国市场、做优做大美洲区域市场具有重大意义。\n■ 项目区位图\n■ 项目位置示意图","content_sha256":"fc75f9d83ec83d2ad2ef02f91876e52509418d699fa41f903fa74eff983a07be","id":17383,"publish_date":"2021-12-22 07:30:02","title":"中国土木签署哥伦比亚太平洋工业园及太阳能电站项目商务合同","title_sha256":"7bd2bfd7b1ec1941e924cfc3a45b4354ac542e1e3206b012d320b05503db411b","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/24810.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"COL-HB-0001","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-04-10T08:29:14.788176","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"COL-HB-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.yidaiyilu.gov.cn/p/099M2E22.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"中国土木在哥伦比亚签署了太平洋工业园及太阳能电站项目商务合同。该项目位于哥伦比亚西部太平洋岸的布埃纳文图拉市，包含轻工业园和太阳能电站建设，具体装机容量未在新闻中披露。项目目前处于商务合同签署阶段。","publish_date":"2021-12-22 07:30:02","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/24810.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"COL-HB-0001","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category"]}
